---
Various sa1100 specific device drivers (mfd, uart, pcmcia,
cpufreq, input, mfd, video, usb, irqchip, dmaengine, hwmon,
gpio) are queued for removal in my board-remove-7.3
branch, I'll submit those after this one is merged.
